@* Race replay chrome — the follow sidebar and the fullscreen close button. Always in the DOM (the map is
   inline); both overlay the map, and are restyled when the #raceHero enters fullscreen. Mirrors the
   segment replay overlay (_SegmentReplayOverlay.cshtml) but is race-owned so the Segments feature stays
   untouched.

   The transport bar is NOT here — it lives in the bottom dock in _RaceHero.cshtml, stacked under the grab
   handle and over the chart strip, so the three are one object you drag. *@

<div id="raceReplaySidebar" class="race-replay-sidebar">
    @* A layout container, not a heading — it holds only the follow toggle + a collapse chevron, so an
       <h6> here announced an empty level-6 heading and jumped the page's heading levels. *@
    <div class="race-replay-sidebar-header" id="raceReplaySidebarHeader">
        <span><i class="bi bi-flag-fill" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <button type="button" id="raceReplayFollowToggle" class="race-replay-follow-toggle"
                title="Camera: follow a rider / free mode">(follow)</button>
        <i class="bi bi-chevron-up race-replay-sidebar-chevron" aria-hidden="true"></i>
    </div>
    @* Real riders, pinned — always visible, a distinct colour from their in-field copy below. *@
    <div id="raceReplaySidebarPinned" class="race-replay-sidebar-pinned"></div>
    <div id="raceReplaySidebarBody" class="race-replay-sidebar-body">
        <div class="race-empty">No field yet — import a results file.</div>
    </div>
    @* Drag (mouse or touch) to make the list wider — more room for names. Width is remembered. *@
    <div id="raceReplaySidebarResize" class="race-replay-sidebar-resize" title="Drag to resize" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</div>

@* Only visible in fullscreen — mirrors the segment replay's floating exit. Exits fullscreen (the replay
   keeps running inline), matching the decoupled Play / fullscreen model. *@
<button id="raceReplayExit" type="button" class="race-replay-exit-float" title="Exit fullscreen" aria-label="Exit fullscreen" style="display:none;">
    <i class="bi bi-x" aria-hidden="true"></i>
</button>
